 \n\n今回のリクエストは、エミヤに夏服を着てほしいです。\n\n今回の依頼では、沖田にはカジュアルな服装で来てほしい。いろいろな例を挙げてみましたが、もし違う服装を考えているのであれば、ご自由にお使いください。 \n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/WbMRXZQ\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/WbMRXZQ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@omame_korokor/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/69d33b8e/uploads/origins/b2cdc7fb-f0ab-43ed-8aac-0678c92fb945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04c4e593fac9f872cdf7e4ba99cd73f5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/69d33b8e/uploads/origins/b2cdc7fb-f0ab-43ed-8aac-0678c92fb945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04c4e593fac9f872cdf7e4ba99cd73f5, https://si.imgix.net/69d33b8e/uploads/origins/b2cdc7fb-f0ab-43ed-8aac-0678c92fb945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ee7772947bff2db1f42288e26fca6eb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/69d33b8e/uploads/origins/b2cdc7fb-f0ab-43ed-8aac-0678c92fb945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=30a00d2e5dcdc8c09b107c2c479260d5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "A couple illustration of Gray and male Ritsuka. Gray sitting on Ritsuka's lap feeding him the chocolates she made for valentine's. Both blushing. Gray could wear her outfit from case files and Ritsuka his artic mystic code.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@omame_korokor/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fed92c42/uploads/origins/9a3b2019-bd16-4cad-a444-72619900a92d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec380f169195f171efb42d47fc30c86c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fed92c42/uploads/origins/9a3b2019-bd16-4cad-a444-72619900a92d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec380f169195f171efb42d47fc30c86c, https://si.imgix.net/fed92c42/uploads/origins/9a3b2019-bd16-4cad-a444-72619900a92d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c1ae057d2